Title: Summary Statistics for Numeric Columns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Isaac", "Isiko", , "isaac.isiko@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes the mean, standard deviation and median of every
    numeric column in a data frame, optionally grouped by one column, and
    returns a tidy tibble.
